Achmage Workbench — rhwp v0.9.0 form of a 0.8.7 engine patch (third_party/hop/patches-0.9.0).
Origin: HOP 0011 (third_party/hop/patches/0011-hop-tab-justify.patch, sha256 cc4043392222ba3dee529883389636c5e305fe828bbcee212ccb5f8e3be4c791; original author hop-workbench <hop@localhost>)
Status: ported
Differs from the 0.8.7 form: rewritten on 0.9.0's per-run no-extra-spacing prefix (hop_last_tab_prefix_by_run): in a justified line with a tab and no inline objects or footnotes only spaces after the last tab get the extra spacing. Not carried: hanging trailing tabs past the right margin in sections whose default tab width is 0.
Regression test: renderer::layout::paragraph_layout tests hop_0011_justify_spreads_only_after_the_last_tab (new)

